---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
// DRAFT — review before launch. Text in [square brackets] needs your decision.
// Carry over the "Remote Access Support Services" and "CCTV Systems" sections from the Wix policy.
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy | Vectr" description="How Vectr collects, uses and protects personal data.">
  <Header />
  <main id="main" class="prose">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>Last updated: [date]</p>

    <h2>Who we are</h2>
    <p>
      Vectr designs, installs and supports networking, security and audio-visual systems for homes and workplaces in the UK.
      We are the data controller for personal data collected through this website. We follow the UK GDPR, the Data
      Protection Act 2018 and the Privacy and Electronic Communications Regulations (PECR).
    </p>

    <h2>What we collect through this website</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Enquiry details</strong> you enter in the contact form: name, email, phone, postcode, the service you're interested in, your preferred date and time for a call, and your message.</li>
      <li><strong>Technical data</strong> processed by our hosting provider to keep the site secure and working, such as your IP address and browser type, including for the Cloudflare Turnstile spam check.</li>
      <li><strong>Aggregate visit statistics</strong> from Cloudflare Web Analytics, which does not use cookies and does not identify you.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How we use it, and our legal basis</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>To reply to your enquiry and arrange the call you asked for — steps taken at your request before entering into a contract.</li>
      <li>To keep the website secure and prevent spam — our legitimate interests.</li>
      <li>To understand how the site is used, in aggregate — our legitimate interests.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We don't use your details for marketing unless you have separately agreed to it, and we never sell them.</p>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>This website does not set advertising or tracking cookies. Cloudflare may use strictly necessary technical measures to protect the site from abuse.</p>

    <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
    <p>We use trusted service providers who process data on our behalf under contract:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Cloudflare — website hosting, security, spam protection and analytics.</li>
      <li>Resend — delivering form submissions to our inbox.</li>
      <li>Google Workspace — our business email.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Some of these providers may process data outside the UK. Where they do, transfers are protected by appropriate
      safeguards, such as the UK International Data Transfer Addendum or the UK Extension to the EU–US Data Privacy Framework.
    </p>

    <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
    <p>
      Enquiries that don't lead to work are deleted after [12 months]. If you become a customer, we keep your records for
      the duration of our work and then for six years for tax and legal purposes.
    </p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      You can ask to access, correct, delete, restrict or object to the processing of your personal data, and to receive a
      copy in a portable format. Contact us at <a href={`mailto:${site.privacyEmail}`}>{site.privacyEmail}</a>. If you're
      unhappy with how we've handled your data, you can complain to the Information Commissioner's Office at
      <a href="https://ico.org.uk" rel="noopener">ico.org.uk</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>Our services are for adults. We don't knowingly collect data from anyone under 16.</p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>We'll post any changes to this policy on this page.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Vectr · <a href={`mailto:${site.privacyEmail}`}>{site.privacyEmail}</a> · <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phoneIntl}</a></p>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Base>
